[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（早く……早く！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Faster... faster!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ、どこへ行っていたの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, where have you been!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも！\u3000ちょうどいいところに！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perfect timing, you two!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと協力してほしいことがあるんだけど！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I need your help with something!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "って感じで……二人には迎撃の手はずを整えてほしくて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So that's the situation... I need you both to help prepare our defenses."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ダメよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Absolutely not."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは、この国を危険に晒すことになる。\n聖戦士としての天命に背く行いだわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That would put our nation at risk. It goes against our divine calling as Sacred Knights."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ここでもまた天命……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(There's that divine calling again...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに、あなたにとってはそれ以前の問題……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, you've got an even bigger problem..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今はそんなこと言ってる場合じゃないよ。\nヤンネさんも分かってるでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There isn't time for that! You understand what's at stake here, don't you, Janne?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このままじゃ、たくさんの人が傷つく……！\n黙って見てるわけにいかないよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we do nothing, many people will get hurt...! We can't just stand by and watch!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに、ギリギリ教えには反してないからさ。\nちゃんと言い訳も考えてあるし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And technically, we're not turning our backs on the teachings. Hear me out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は当然、姉様に賛成よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I stand with Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤンネさん！\u3000今はとにかく時間がないんだよ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne! We're running out of time!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……分かったわ。今回だけよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Fine. Just this once."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう！\u3000じゃ、頼んだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you! I'm counting on you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（天命、天命、もういいわ！！\n\u3000アタシも、自分のやりたいようにやらせてもらう！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Divine calling this, divine calling that—I've had enough!! I'm going to do what I feel is right!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（行動に責任もって！\u3000やり遂げる！！\n\u3000それはアタシが決めた、アタシの使命！！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I'll take responsibility for my actions! I'll see this through!! This is the calling that I've chosen for myself!!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと、レスナたちが泊まってる宿って確か……\nあ、いた！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, where was that inn Resna and the others were staying at... Ah, there it is!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ウィルベルさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ！\u3000レスナたちって今どうしてる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina! How are Resna and the others faring?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "実は今、面倒なことに巻き込まれてて……\nちょっと、ウィルベルさんの力を貸してほしいんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're caught up with something... so I came to ask your help with this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういうこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you need?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今、海に現れた頂獣の亡霊が定期船を襲おうとしてる。\nどうにかして助けなくちゃいけない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The spirit of an Apexi is threatening passenger ships at sea. We have to help them somehow."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから、頂獣を誘導して、この島まで連れてきます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My plan is to lure it to the island!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What? That's..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすがに倒しに行くのは無謀ですから。\nでも、島には聖戦士たちや、イェルカもいる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Going out to fight it would be too reckless. But here, we have the Sacred Knights and Jelka to help us."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "船を助け、あの頂獣をやっつけるには、\nこれが一番確実なんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is our best shot at saving the ships and dealing with that Apexi."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……で、どうしてあたしの力が必要なわけ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...And why exactly do you need my help?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さっき採取に行った時にした約束、覚えてます？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Remember that promise you made when we went gathering ingredients?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、ホウキのこと？\u3000……あんた、まさか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, about the broom? ...Wait, you're not saying..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのまさか！\u3000対価は必ず後から払うから、\nその約束、今使わせてください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's exactly what I'm saying! I'll pay you back later, I promise. Just let me cash in that favor now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもねえ……この雨の中飛ぶなんて\nちょっと遠慮したいんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you know... flying in this rain isn't exactly..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか……できないんですか。\nすごい魔法使いだって聞いて期待してたのに……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... so you can't do it? And here I thought you were such an amazing witch..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "む。いや、できないとは言ってないけどね？\nやろうと思えばもちろんできるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey now. I never said I couldn't do it. Of course I could if I wanted to."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっぱり！\u3000さすが大魔法使いウィルベル様！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that so?! You really are a great witch!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "変わり身はやっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Uh? What's with that change of tune?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ウィルベル様のお力が、どうしても必要なんです！\nどうかお恵みを～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh great and powerful Wilbell, we desperately need your abilities! Please lend us your aid!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ……調子いいんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*sigh*... You're laying it on pretty thick."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいわよ。力になってあげる。\nただ、ちゃんとそっちの約束も果たしてもらうわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fine, I'll help. But you owe me one."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やったあ！\u3000ありがとう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、アタシ持って行くものあるんで。\n海岸のほうで待っててください！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I need to grab some things first. Meet me at the shore!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]